Version 4
SymbolType BLOCK
RECTANGLE Normal 48 64 -48 -64
WINDOW 0 0 -64 Bottom 2
WINDOW 3 2 62 Top 2
SYMATTR Value PA340
SYMATTR Prefix X
SYMATTR ModelFile ./PA340_Pspice.LIB
PIN -48 0 LEFT 8
PINATTR PinName in+
PINATTR SpiceOrder 1
PIN -48 -32 LEFT 8
PINATTR PinName in-
PINATTR SpiceOrder 2
PIN -48 32 LEFT 8
PINATTR PinName V+
PINATTR SpiceOrder 3
PIN 48 -48 RIGHT 8
PINATTR PinName -V
PINATTR SpiceOrder 4
PIN 48 -16 RIGHT 8
PINATTR PinName out
PINATTR SpiceOrder 5
PIN 48 16 RIGHT 8
PINATTR PinName 6
PINATTR SpiceOrder 6
PIN 48 48 RIGHT 8
PINATTR PinName 7
PINATTR SpiceOrder 7
